<section id="A2.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS2.6" class="ltx_text">B-B</span>2 </span><span id="A2.SS2.SSS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Weight Update at layer <math id="A2.SS2.SSS2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="A2.SS2.SSS2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\partial L^{(\ell)}}{\partial w^{(\ell})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">𝐎𝐏𝐄𝐍</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em">∂</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">𝐂𝐋𝐎𝐒𝐄</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\partial L^{(\ell)}}{\partial w^{(\ell})}</annotation></semantics></math></span></h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here the loss is defined by grouping channels <math id="A2.SS2.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math> into subsets <math id="A2.SS2.SSS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
