<section id="A3.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A3.SS6.6" class="ltx_text">C-F</span> </span><span id="A3.SS6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Error Convergence Plots</span></h3>

<div id="A3.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The prediction error convergence results for different datasets are shown in Figure <a href="#A3.F5" title="Fig. 5 ‣ C-F Error Convergence Plots ‣ Appendix C Supplementary: ‣ Energy-Efficient Supervised Learning with aBinary Stochastic Forward-Forward Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F5" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2507.06461v1/MNIST_combined_prediction_error_convergence.svg" id="A3.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2507.06461v1/FMNIST_combined_prediction_error_convergence.svg" id="A3.F5.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2507.06461v1/CIFAR10_combined_prediction_error_convergence.svg" id="A3.F5.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 5: </span>Prediction error convergence plots for MNIST, FMNIST, and CIFAR-10 (from left to right).</figcaption>
</figure>
